            <title>2.10.28</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 16 Jul 2026 03:39:07 -0700</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/LakshyaSingh/now-updates/releases</link>
            <sparkle:version>46</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.10.28</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.28

- Added automatic recovery from stalled Chrome, AppleScript, and MediaRemote requests without restarting Now.
- Serialized browser polling, reused the known music tab, and force-reset stale browser processes after timeouts.
- Made Show Overlay restart the monitoring transport while preserving the last valid track.
- Added Active/Dock, built-in MacBook, and persistent external-display targeting in Position settings.
- Added safe display fallback when a selected monitor disconnects, with automatic restoration after reconnecting.
]]></description>
